---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ProductCard from '../components/ProductCard.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Forfactor" description="Forfactor is an Australian technology company building useful digital products for people and businesses.">
  <section class="hero hero-v2">
    <div class="hero-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="shell hero-grid reveal">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> Independent technology company · Australia</p>
        <h1>Useful tech.<br/><em>Real life.</em></h1>
        <p class="lede">We build focused digital products that help people connect, learn and run better businesses.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-bright" href="/products/">Explore our products</a><a class="text-link" href="/about/">Meet Forfactor</a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-art" aria-label="Three Forfactor products connected to a shared technology core">
        <img src="/images/forfactor-hero.png" alt="Abstract sculptural forms representing Forfactor's social, business and learning products" width="1648" height="920" fetchpriority="high" />
        <span class="art-label label-keenout"><b>Keenout</b><small>Social discovery</small></span>
        <span class="art-label label-heela"><b>Heela</b><small>Business AI</small></span>
        <span class="art-label label-pronovo"><b>Pronovo</b><small>Language learning</small></span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="shell hero-foot"><span>Products with a clear purpose</span><span>Designed and built in Australia</span><span>Made for the real world</span></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section products-intro">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">What we build</p><div><h2>Different products.<br/><em>One point of view.</em></h2><p>We focus on clear human needs, then use thoughtful technology to make the experience simpler.</p></div></div>
      <div class="product-grid"><ProductCard number="SOCIAL" name="Keenout" description="Discover local events, meet people and make real-life plans." href="/products/keenout/" featured/><ProductCard number="BUSINESS" name="Heela" description="An AI-powered phone receptionist platform for businesses." href="/products/heela/" status="In development"/><ProductCard number="LEARNING" name="Pronovo" description="Accessible language learning built around consistent practice." href="/products/pronovo/"/></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="visual-stories">
    <article class="story story-keenout">
      <div class="shell story-grid">
        <div class="story-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Keenout · Live now</p><h2>Turn “we should” into <em>we did.</em></h2><p>Discover local events, find people who share your interests and make plans that happen away from the screen.</p><a class="button" href="https://keenout.com.au">Discover Keenout</a></div>
        <div class="keenout-collage" aria-label="A selection of events available through Keenout">
          <figure class="photo-card photo-main"><img src="https://www.keenout.com.au/images/keenout-home-hero-v2-1024.webp" alt="Friends enjoying time together outdoors" loading="lazy"/><figcaption><span>Sydney this weekend</span><b>Find your next plan</b></figcaption></figure>
          <figure class="photo-card photo-small photo-art"><img src="https://www.keenout.com.au/images/weekend-events/sidefx-art-exhibition-gallery.webp" alt="Art exhibition event" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>Art & culture</figcaption></figure>
          <figure class="photo-card photo-small photo-play"><img src="https://www.keenout.com.au/activity-billiards.webp" alt="People playing billiards" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>Social activities</figcaption></figure>
          <div class="keenout-badge"><img src="https://www.keenout.com.au/brand/generated/keenout-logo-96.png" alt=""/><span><b>Keenout</b><small>Go out. Do more.</small></span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="story story-heela">
      <div class="shell story-grid story-reverse">
        <div class="heela-console" aria-label="Conceptual illustration of an AI phone receptionist handling a call">
          <div class="console-bar"><span class="console-logo">H</span><b>Heela reception</b><span class="live-pill"><i></i> On call</span></div>
          <div class="call-layout">
            <div class="caller"><span class="avatar">JL</span><small>INCOMING CALL</small><h3>Jordan Lee</h3><p>“I’d like to book a service for Thursday afternoon.”</p><div class="wave" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div>
            <div class="call-action"><small>CALL OUTCOME</small><strong>Appointment request captured</strong><div><span>Thursday</span><span>2–5 pm</span></div><button type="button">Ready for follow-up</button></div>
          </div>
          <div class="console-foot"><span>Natural conversation</span><span>Clear handover</span><span>Always available</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="story-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Heela · In development</p><h2>Every call gets a <em>good answer.</em></h2><p>An AI-powered phone receptionist platform designed to help businesses respond consistently and capture what matters.</p><a class="button button-light" href="/products/heela/">Explore Heela</a></div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="story story-pronovo">
      <div class="shell story-grid">
        <div class="story-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Pronovo · Learning</p><h2>A clearer path to <em>progress.</em></h2><p>Accessible language learning built around consistent practice—so learners can keep building skills over time.</p><a class="button" href="https://pronovo.org">Visit Pronovo</a></div>
        <div class="learning-board" aria-label="Conceptual language learning pathway">
          <div class="lesson-nav"><img src="https://www.pronovo.org/app-icon-512.png" alt=""/><span><b>Pronovo</b><small>Today’s practice</small></span><strong>68%</strong></div>
          <div class="phrase-card"><small>EVERYDAY PHRASE</small><h3>Good morning</h3><p>Buenos días</p><button type="button" aria-label="Play pronunciation">▶</button></div>
          <div class="path-row"><span class="path-done">✓</span><i></i><span class="path-active">A</span><i></i><span>B</span><i></i><span>C</span></div>
          <div class="learning-foot"><span><b>12</b><small>Day streak</small></span><span><b>84</b><small>Words practised</small></span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="section alt"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow"><span></span> Our approach</p><div><h2>Technology should earn its place.</h2><p>We start with a real human need, remove the unnecessary, and build the smallest thing that can make a meaningful difference.</p></div></div><div class="principles"><div class="principle"><span class="principle-icon">◎</span><span class="eyebrow">OUTCOMES</span><h3>Start with people</h3><p>We begin with the progress someone is trying to make—not the technology we want to use.</p></div><div class="principle"><span class="principle-icon">◇</span><span class="eyebrow">CLARITY</span><h3>Make it obvious</h3><p>Thoughtful structure and plain language make powerful products feel simple.</p></div><div class="principle"><span class="principle-icon">✦</span><span class="eyebrow">PROGRESS</span><h3>Build to improve</h3><p>We create reliable foundations, learn from use and make each release more useful.</p></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="section tight"><div class="shell cta"><h2>Have something useful in mind?</h2><a class="button" href="mailto:hello@forfactor.com">hello@forfactor.com</a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
